msgstr "啟用後，快速操作面板的快速鍵（預設為空格鍵）可在任何頁面開啟操作搜尋。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Recent actions"
msgstr "最近的操作"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Unit shown after the number of recent actions, as in "5 actions".
msgid "actions"
msgstr "個操作"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How many recently launched actions to show at the top of the Speed Dial. Set "
"to 0 to hide recent actions."
msgstr "在快速操作面板頂端顯示的最近執行操作數量。設為 0 可隱藏最近的操作。"

# AI Translated
msgid "CAD feature (experimental)"
msgstr "CAD 功能（實驗性）"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, the Design tab is shown, where models can be built "
"and edited parametrically. This feature is experimental and still under "
"development."
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後會顯示「設計」分頁，可在其中以參數化方式建立與編輯模型。此功能為"
"實驗性質，仍在開發中。"

msgid "Pop up to select filament grouping mode"
msgstr "彈出視窗選擇線材分組模式"

# AI Translated
msgid "Visible plugin pages"
msgstr "可見的外掛頁面數"

# AI Translated
msgid "pages"
msgstr "頁"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Number of plugin pages shown as fixed tabs before the remaining pages "
"collapse into a dropdown on the last tab."
msgstr ""
"以固定分頁顯示的外掛頁面數量，其餘頁面會收合至最後一個分頁的下拉選單中。"

msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行為"

msgid "Auto flush after changing..."
msgstr "變更後自動清除..."

msgid "Auto calculate flushing volumes when selected values changed"
msgstr "當選擇的值變更時自動計算清除體積"

msgid "Auto arrange plate after cloning"
msgstr "複製後自動排列列印板"

msgid "Show options when adding a primitive"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If enabled, a dialog asks for the dimensions of a primitive shape before it "
"is added."
msgstr ""

msgid "Auto slice after changes"
msgstr "變更後自動切片"

msgid ""
"If enabled, OrcaSlicer will re-slice automatically whenever slicing-related "
"settings change."
msgstr "啟用後，OrcaSlicer 將在切片相關設定變更時自動重新切片。"

msgid ""
"Delay in seconds before auto slicing starts, allowing multiple edits to be "
"grouped. Use 0 to slice immediately."
msgstr "自動切片開始前的延遲秒數，允許將多個編輯分組。使用 0 立即切片。"

msgid "Remove mixed temperature restriction"
msgstr "移除混合溫度限制"

msgid ""
"With this option enabled, you can print materials with a large temperature "
"difference together."
msgstr "啟用此選項後，您可以同時列印溫度差異較大的材料。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remember last print action"
msgstr "記住上次的列印操作"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, OrcaSlicer will remember the last selected option in the print "
"button's dropdown (e.g. Print, Export plate sliced file, Export G-code file) "
"and use it as the default on next startup."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，OrcaSlicer 會記住列印按鈕下拉選單中上次選擇的選項（例如列印、匯出單一"
"列印板切片檔案、匯出 G-code 檔案），並在下次啟動時作為預設值。"

msgid "Camera"
msgstr "攝影機"

msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "觸控板"

msgid "Camera style"
msgstr "相機模式"

msgid ""
"Select camera navigation style.\n"
"Default: LMB+move for rotation, RMB/MMB+move for panning.\n"
"Touchpad: Alt+move for rotation, Shift+move for panning."
msgstr ""
"選擇相機導航樣式。\n"
"預設：左鍵+移動旋轉，右鍵/中鍵+移動平移。\n"
"觸控板：Alt+移動旋轉，Shift+移動平移。"

msgid "Orbit speed multiplier"
msgstr "視角旋轉速度倍率"

msgid "Multiplies the orbit speed for finer or coarser camera movement."
msgstr "調整視角速度，使鏡頭移動更細緻或更快速。"

msgid "Zoom to mouse position"
msgstr "放大到滑鼠位置"

msgid ""
"Zoom in towards the mouse pointer's position in the 3D view, rather than the "
"2D window center."
msgstr "在 3D 視圖中以滑鼠指標的位置為中心放大，而非以 2D 視窗中心放大。"

msgid "Use free camera"
msgstr "使用自由鏡頭"

msgid "If enabled, use free camera. If not enabled, use constrained camera."
msgstr "如果啟用，則使用自由鏡頭。若未啟用，則使用受限鏡頭。"

msgid "Reverse mouse zoom"
msgstr "反轉滑鼠滾輪縮放方向"

msgid "If enabled, reverses the direction of zoom with mouse wheel."
msgstr "啟用後，改變滑鼠滾輪縮放方向。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Draw mate connectors as a face"
msgstr "將結合連接器繪製為面"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"In the Design tab, draw a mate connector as a small face instead of the "
"conventional disc with a roll quadrant. A face shows its orientation at a "
"glance, without learning the disc convention. Turn this off for the "
"conventional CAD representation."
msgstr ""
"在「設計」分頁中，將結合連接器繪製為一個小面，而非傳統帶有滾轉象限的圓盤。面"
"的方向一目了然，無需先學會圓盤的表示慣例。關閉此選項可使用傳統的 CAD 表示方"
"式。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto-close sketch loops"
msgstr "自動封閉草圖迴圈"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Treat sketch endpoints within 0.001 mm as one joint and weld the loop shut. "
"Off: only exactly coincident endpoints join, so a loop with a tiny gap is "
"shown as open instead of being closed for you. Saved with each design; "
"applies to designs started after the change."
msgstr ""
"將相距 0.001 mm 以內的草圖端點視為同一接點，並將迴圈接合封閉。關閉時：只有完"
"全重合的端點才會相接，因此有微小缺口的迴圈會顯示為開放，而不會自動為您封閉。"
"此設定會隨每個設計一併儲存；僅套用於變更後開始的設計。"

msgid "Pan"
msgstr "平移"

msgid "Left Mouse Drag"
msgstr "滑鼠左鍵拖曳"

msgid "Set the action that dragging the left mouse button should perform."
msgstr "設定拖曳滑鼠左鍵時應執行的動作。"

msgid "Middle Mouse Drag"
msgstr "滑鼠中鍵拖曳"

msgid "Set the action that dragging the middle mouse button should perform."
msgstr "設定拖曳滑鼠中鍵時應執行的動作。"

msgid "Right Mouse Drag"
msgstr "滑鼠右鍵拖曳"

msgid "Set the action that dragging the right mouse button should perform."
msgstr "設定拖曳滑鼠右鍵時應執行的動作。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "鍵盤"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "快速鍵"

# AI Translated
msgid "Choose the key for each action."
msgstr "為每個操作選擇按鍵。"

msgid "Clear my choice on..."
msgstr "清除我的選擇於..."

msgid "Unsaved projects"
msgstr "未儲存的專案"

msgid "Clear my choice on the unsaved projects."
msgstr "清除我對未儲存專案的選擇。"

msgid "Unsaved presets"
msgstr "未儲存的預設"

msgid "Clear my choice on the unsaved presets."
msgstr "清除我對未儲存預設的選擇。"

msgid "Synchronizing printer preset"
msgstr "同步列印設備預設"

msgid ""
"Clear my choice for synchronizing printer preset after loading the file."
msgstr "清除我在載入檔案後同步列印設備預設的選擇。"

msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "圖形"

msgid "Smooth normals"
msgstr "平滑法線"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies smooth normals to the model.\n"
"\n"
"Requires manual scene reload to take effect (right-click on 3D view → "
"\"Reload All\")."
msgstr ""
"對模型套用平滑法線。\n"
"\n"
"需要手動重新載入場景才會生效（在 3D 視圖上按滑鼠右鍵 → 「重新載入全部」）。"

msgid "Phong shading"
msgstr "Phong 著色"

msgid "Uses Phong shading inside realistic view."
msgstr "在擬真檢視中使用 Phong 著色。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable in Preview"
msgstr "在預覽中啟用"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Also applies realistic view to the Preview canvas, not just Prepare.\n"
"Preview draws the full toolpath geometry, so shadows and SSAO cost "
"considerably more there than on a plain model."
msgstr ""
"擬真視圖也會套用於預覽畫布，而不僅限於準備。\n"
"預覽會繪製完整的工具路徑幾何，因此陰影與 SSAO 在預覽中的效能消耗遠高於一般模"
"型。"

msgid "SSAO ambient occlusion"
msgstr "SSAO 環境光遮蔽"

msgid "Applies SSAO in realistic view."
msgstr "在寫實渲染中套用 SSAO。"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Realistic-view shadow mode: the light stays fixed in the scene.
msgid "Static"
msgstr "靜態"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Realistic-view shadow mode: the light turns with the camera.
msgid "Orbit"
msgstr "環繞"

msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "陰影"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Renders cast shadows on the plate, other objects, and each object onto "
"itself in realistic view.\n"
"Static: the light stays fixed in the world, so the shadows are only "
"recomputed when the scene changes.\n"
"Orbit: the light turns with the camera, recomputing the shadows every frame "
"the camera moves."
msgstr ""
"在擬真視圖中，於列印板、其他物件以及每個物件自身上渲染投射陰影。\n"
"靜態：光源固定於場景中，因此只有在場景變更時才會重新計算陰影。\n"
"環繞：光源隨相機轉動，相機移動時每一影格都會重新計算陰影。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Glossy toolpaths"
msgstr "亮面工具路徑"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: Preferences > Preview tooltip: check 'highlight' (the specular shine) reads as 高光 and 'plain view' (the normal, non-realistic 3D view) as 一般視圖.
msgid ""
"Highlights the toolpaths in Preview as glossy plastic in realistic view.\n"
"Off, a translucent filament is matte and an opaque one keeps the highlight "
"of the plain view."
msgstr ""
"在擬真視圖中，讓預覽中的工具路徑呈現亮面塑膠的高光。\n"
"關閉時，半透明線材為霧面，不透明線材則維持一般視圖的高光。"

msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "抗鋸齒"

msgid "MSAA Multiplier"
msgstr "MSAA 倍數"

msgid ""
"Set the Multi-Sample Anti-Aliasing level.\n"
"Higher values result in smoother edges, but the impact on performance is "
"exponential.\n"
"Lower values improve performance, at the cost of jagged edges.\n"
"If disabled, its recommended to enable FXAA to reduce jagged edges with "
"minimal performance impact.\n"
"\n"
"Requires application restart."
msgstr ""
"設定多重取樣抗鋸齒等級。\n"
"數值越高邊緣越平滑，但對效能的影響呈指數級增長。\n"
"數值越低可提升效能，但代價是邊緣出現鋸齒。\n"
"若停用，建議啟用 FXAA，以最小的效能影響來減少鋸齒邊緣。\n"
"\n"
"需要重新啟動應用程式。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "停用"

msgid "FXAA post-processing"
msgstr "FXAA 後處理"

msgid ""
"Applies Fast Approximate Anti-Aliasing as a screen-space pass.\n"
"Useful for disabling or reducing the MSAA setting to improve performance.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"以螢幕空間處理的方式套用快速近似抗鋸齒。\n"
"適合用於停用或降低 MSAA 設定以提升效能。\n"
"\n"
"立即生效。"

msgid "FPS"
msgstr "FPS"

msgid "FPS cap"
msgstr "FPS 上限"

msgid "(0 = unlimited)"
msgstr "(0 = 無限制)"

msgid ""
"Limits viewport frame rate to reduce GPU load and power usage.\n"
"Set to 0 for unlimited frame rate."
msgstr ""
"限制視埠影格率以降低 GPU 負載與耗電量。\n"
"設為 0 表示不限制影格率。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Reuse the 3D scene while idle"
msgstr "閒置時重複使用 3D 場景"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Skips redrawing the 3D scene when only the mouse cursor moves over the "
"viewport,\n"
"and reuses the previous frame's scene instead. Reduces GPU load.\n"
"Disable it if the viewport shows stale or missing contents.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"當只有滑鼠游標在視埠上移動時，略過重新繪製 3D 場景，\n"
"改為重複使用上一影格的場景。可降低 GPU 負載。\n"
"若視埠顯示過時或缺少的內容，請停用此選項。\n"
"\n"
"立即生效。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip unchanged frames"
msgstr "略過未變更的影格"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Skips drawing a frame altogether when it would be identical to the one "
"already on screen.\n"
"Only applies to frames that reuse the 3D scene, so it needs Reuse the 3D "
"scene while idle.\n"
"Disable it if a hover highlight, tooltip or animation stops updating.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"當影格與螢幕上現有的影格完全相同時，完全略過繪製。\n"
"僅適用於重複使用 3D 場景的影格，因此需要啟用「閒置時重複使用 3D 場景」。\n"
"若懸停醒目提示、工具提示或動畫停止更新，請停用此選項。\n"
"\n"
"立即生效。"

msgid "Show FPS overlay"
msgstr "顯示 FPS 疊加層"

# AI Translated
msgid "Displays rendering counts in the top-right corner of the viewport."
msgstr "在視埠右上角顯示渲染計數。"

# AI Translated
msgid "FPS: frames presented to the screen per second."
msgstr "FPS：每秒呈現到螢幕上的影格數。"

# AI Translated
msgid "3D: frames per second that redrew the 3D scene."
msgstr "3D：每秒重新繪製 3D 場景的影格數。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Show render timings"
msgstr "顯示渲染時間"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Displays how many milliseconds each part of a frame that redraws the 3D "
"scene takes, in the top-right corner of the viewport."
msgstr "在視埠右上角顯示重新繪製 3D 場景的影格中，每個部分各花費多少毫秒。"

# AI Translated
msgid "CPU: time spent issuing the drawing commands."
msgstr "CPU：發出繪圖指令所花費的時間。"

# AI Translated
msgid "GPU: time the graphics card spent running them."
msgstr "GPU：顯示卡執行這些指令所花費的時間。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adds a small overhead to each frame while enabled."
msgstr "啟用時會為每個影格增加少量額外負擔。"

# AI Translated
msgid "3D scene benchmark"
msgstr "3D 場景效能測試"

# AI Translated
msgid "Run"
msgstr "執行"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Replaces the current project with the OrcaSliced Combo, then measures the "
"frame rate and render timings while the camera turns around it in Prepare "
"and Preview, and while the layer slider moves through the sliced layers."
msgstr ""
"以 OrcaSliced Combo 取代目前專案，接著在相機於準備與預覽中環繞模型轉動時，以"
"及層滑桿在已切片的各層間移動時，測量影格率與渲染時間。"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code Preview"
msgstr "G-code 預覽"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default view type"
msgstr "預設檢視類型"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The color scheme the sliced preview opens with.\n"
"Automatic: Filament for multi material prints, Line Type for single material "
"ones.\n"
"Last used: the view type you selected last.\n"
"Any other value always opens that view type.\n"
"You can still switch the view type in the preview afterwards."
msgstr ""
"開啟切片預覽時使用的配色方案。\n"
"自動：多材料列印使用「線材」，單一材料列印使用「走線類型」。\n"
"上次使用：您上次選擇的檢視類型。\n"
"其他任何值則一律以該檢視類型開啟。\n"
"之後您仍可在預覽中切換檢視類型。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Dim lower layers"
msgstr "使下方層變暗"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When scrubbing the layer slider in the sliced preview, render the layers "
"below the current one darkened so that only the layer being viewed is shown "
"at full brightness."
msgstr ""
"在切片預覽中拖曳層滑桿時，將目前層以下的各層算繪為變暗，如此只有正在檢視的層"
"以全亮度顯示。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Dimmed layer brightness"
msgstr "變暗層的亮度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How brightly the dimmed layers are rendered when \"Dim lower layers\" is "
"enabled.\n"
"99% is barely darkened, 0% renders them black. Capped at 99% because 100% "
"would be the same as disabling the option."
msgstr ""
"啟用「使下方層變暗」時，變暗的層以多高的亮度顯示。\n"
"99% 幾乎不會變暗，0% 會顯示為全黑。上限為 99%，因為 100% 與停用此選項的效果相"
"同。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Translucent filaments"
msgstr "半透明線材"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Draw the toolpaths of filaments whose color is partly transparent as see-"
"through, as the 3D view draws their objects. Turn it off to draw every "
"filament opaque."
msgstr ""
"將顏色帶有部分透明度的線材，其工具路徑以半透明方式繪製，如同 3D 視圖繪製其物"
"件的方式。關閉後，所有線材皆以不透明方式繪製。"

msgid "Login region"
msgstr "登入區域"

msgid "Stealth mode"
msgstr "區域網路模式"

msgid ""
"This disables all cloud features, including Orca Cloud profile syncing. "
"Users who prefer to work entirely offline can enable this option.\n"
"Note: When Stealth Mode is enabled, your user profiles will not be backed up "
"to Orca Cloud."
msgstr ""
"這會停用所有雲端功能，包括 Orca Cloud 設定檔同步。偏好完全離線工作的使用者可"
"以啟用此選項。\n"
"注意：啟用隱身模式時，您的使用者設定檔將不會備份到 Orca Cloud。"

msgid "Hide login side panel"
msgstr "隱藏登入側邊面板"

msgid "Hide the login side panel on the home page."
msgstr "隱藏首頁上的登入側邊面板。"

msgid "Network test"
msgstr "網路測試"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "測試"

msgid "Cloud Providers"
msgstr "雲端供應商"

msgid "Enable Bambu Cloud"
msgstr "啟用 Bambu Cloud"

msgid ""
"Allow logging into Bambu Cloud alongside Orca Cloud. When enabled, a Bambu "
"login section appears on the homepage."
msgstr ""
"允許在登入 Orca Cloud 的同時登入 Bambu Cloud。啟用後，首頁會顯示 Bambu 登入區"
"塊。"

msgid "Update & sync"
msgstr "更新與同步"

msgid "Check for stable updates only"
msgstr "僅檢查穩定版更新"

msgid "Auto sync user presets (Printer/Filament/Process)"
msgstr "自動同步使用者預設（列印設備/線材/列印品質參數）"

msgid "Filament sync mode"
msgstr "線材同步模式"

msgid ""
"Choose whether sync updates both filament preset and color, or only color."
msgstr "選擇同步時是否更新線材預設與顏色，還是僅更新顏色。"

msgid "Filament & Color"
msgstr "線材與顏色"

msgid "Color only"
msgstr "僅顏色"

msgid "Update built-in presets automatically."
msgstr "自動更新系統預設。"

msgid "Use encrypted file for token storage"
msgstr "使用加密檔案儲存權杖"

msgid ""
"Store authentication tokens in an encrypted file instead of the system "
"keychain. (Requires restart)"
msgstr "將身份驗證權杖儲存在加密檔案中，而不是系統鑰匙圈。（需要重啟）"

msgid "Bambu network plug-in"
msgstr "Bambu 網路外掛程式"

msgid "Enable Bambu network plug-in"
msgstr "啟用 Bambu 網路外掛程式"

msgid "Network plug-in version"
msgstr "網路外掛程式版本"

msgid "Select the network plug-in version to use"
msgstr "選擇要使用的網路外掛程式版本"

msgid "Associate"
msgstr "關聯"

msgid "Associate files to XDesktop"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"File associations for the Microsoft Store version are managed by Windows "
"Settings."
msgstr "Microsoft Store 版本的檔案關聯由 Windows 設定管理。"

msgid "Open Windows Default Apps Settings"
msgstr "開啟 Windows 預設應用程式設定"

msgid "Associate .3mf files to XDesktop"
msgstr ""

msgid "If enabled, sets XDesktop as default application to open .3mf files"
msgstr ""

msgid "Associate DRC files to XDesktop"
msgstr ""

msgid "If enabled, sets XDesktop as default application to open DRC files."
msgstr ""

msgid "Associate .stl files to XDesktop"
msgstr ""

msgid "If enabled, sets XDesktop as default application to open .stl files"
msgstr ""

msgid "Associate .step/.stp files to XDesktop"
msgstr ""

msgid "If enabled, sets XDesktop as default application to open .step files"
msgstr ""

msgid "Associate web links to XDesktop"
msgstr ""

msgid "Developer"
msgstr "開發者"

msgid "Skip AMS blacklist check"
