# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Multi-color prints in IDEX/IQEX parallel modes require each filament to have "
"its own dedicated physical extruder. Two or more of the active filaments are "
"routed to the same physical head via the printer's physical extruder map (an "
"MMU/AFC manifold), which the slaved gantry cannot follow."
msgstr ""
"在 IDEX/IQEX 並行模式下進行多色列印時，每種線材都必須有專屬的實體擠出機。目前"
"有兩種以上使用中的線材經由列印裝置的實體擠出機映射（MMU/AFC 匯流器）送入同一"
"個實體工具頭，從動龍門無法跟隨這種情況。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The active IDEX/IQEX mode does not define a primary tool, so multi-color "
"printing cannot be scheduled. Open the printer settings IDEX/IQEX Modes "
"editor and assign a Primary role to one tool."
msgstr ""
"目前的 IDEX/IQEX 模式未定義主工具頭，因此無法安排多色列印。請開啟列印裝置設定"
"中的 IDEX/IQEX 模式編輯器，並將主（Primary）角色指派給其中一個工具頭。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Multi-color in this mode isn't a parallel-print scenario — all of the active "
"tools sit on a single gantry, so there's no second gantry being copied or "
"mirrored to. Switch the plate to Primary mode for multi-color printing on a "
"single gantry, or define an IDEX/IQEX mode that includes tools on a second "
"gantry."
msgstr ""
"此模式下的多色列印並不屬於並行列印：所有使用中的工具頭都位於同一個龍門上，沒"
"有第二個龍門可供複製或鏡像。若要在單一龍門上進行多色列印，請將列印板切換為主"
"模式；或定義一個包含第二個龍門上工具頭的 IDEX/IQEX 模式。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Multi-color prints in IDEX/IQEX parallel modes require a Span tool on the "
"primary's gantry — without one, the mode doesn't declare a within-gantry "
"multicolor partner. Either reduce the print to a single filament, switch to "
"Primary mode, or open the printer settings IDEX/IQEX Modes editor and mark a "
"tool on the primary's gantry as Span."
msgstr ""
"在 IDEX/IQEX 並行模式下進行多色列印時，主工具頭所在的龍門上必須有一個 Span 工"
"具頭；否則此模式未宣告同一龍門內的多色搭檔。請將列印減少為單一線材、切換至主"
"模式，或開啟列印裝置設定中的 IDEX/IQEX 模式編輯器，將主工具頭所在龍門上的一個"
"工具頭標記為 Span。"

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is a list of tools such as "T0/T1", %2% a filament number.
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"In this Span mode, colors are printed only by %1%, but filament %2% isn't "
"routed to any tool. Use filaments routed to %1%, or switch this plate to "
"Primary mode."
msgstr ""
"在此 Span 模式下，只有 %1% 會列印顏色，但線材 %2% 未分配給任何工具。請使用分"
"配給 %1% 的線材，或將此列印板切換為主模式。"

# AI Translated
