msgstr "在輸送帶列印裝置上，Brim 與螺旋花瓶模式不相容。請停用其中之一。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The belt is too steep for a brim, so no brim will be generated."
msgstr "輸送帶傾斜角度過大，不適合使用 Brim，因此不會產生 Brim。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A brim is only generated when the belt is tilted. Set a belt tilt angle, or "
"remove the brim setting."
msgstr ""
"僅在輸送帶傾斜時才會產生 Brim。請設定輸送帶傾斜角度，或移除 Brim 設定。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Belt printers support outer and inner brim only. Auto, Mouse ear and Painted "
"brim are printed as Outer brim only, using Brim width."
msgstr ""
"輸送帶列印裝置僅支援外側和內側 Brim。「自動」、「圓盤」和「繪製」Brim 會以"
"「僅外側」方式列印，並使用「Brim 寬度」。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Brim-object gap separates the leading brim from the object's leading edge, "
"which is the edge it is meant to anchor. Set the gap to 0 when using leading "
"brim length."
msgstr ""
"「Brim 與物件的間隙」會使前緣 Brim 與物件的前緣分離，而前緣正是前緣 Brim 要固"
"定的邊。使用「前緣 Brim 長度」時，請將間隙設為 0。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Leading brim length extends ahead of each object along the belt, and Arrange "
"does not reserve that space. Leave room between objects."
msgstr ""
"「前緣 Brim 長度」會沿輸送帶向每個物件前方延伸，而「自動擺放」不會預留該空"
