# AI Translated
msgid ""
"\"Leading edge only\" brim applies to belt printers. On this printer it is "
"printed as an ordinary outer brim."
msgstr ""
"「僅前緣」Brim 僅適用於輸送帶列印裝置。在此列印裝置上，它會以一般的外側 Brim "
"列印。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A gradient mixed filament is used, but 'Mixed color sublayer' is disabled. "
