msgstr "逐件列印模式下不支援使用平滑模式的縮時錄影。"

msgid ""
"Clumping detection is not supported when \"by object\" sequence is enabled."
msgstr "啟用“按物件”序列時，不支援結塊檢測。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The belt purge tower is not generated in \"By object\" print sequence; "
