msgstr "在「逐件」列印順序下不會產生輸送帶清理塔；線材更換時將不會清理。"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The belt purge tower is enabled but the project has no purge tower object; "
"filament changes will not be purged. Open the project in the application to "
