msgid ""
"Enabling both precise Z height and the prime tower may cause slicing errors."
msgstr "同時啟用精確 Z 高度和擦拭塔可能會導致切片錯誤。"

msgid ""
"A prime tower is required for clumping detection; otherwise, there may be "
